# Campaign Index — {{CAMPAIGN_TITLE}}

A navigable map of the campaign: every experiment traceable to its config, code snapshot, result,
figures, and status. **The setup skill creates this file; the loop agent MAINTAINS it** — add a row for
every experiment (see the loop's UPDATE step in `docs/program.md`). The scoreboard holds the *numbers*;
this index holds the *pointers* so a human or a fresh agent can find anything from one place.

## Key documents
- Loop charter: [`docs/program.md`](../docs/program.md) · Physics: [`docs/PHYSICS.md`](../docs/PHYSICS.md)
  · Conventions: [`docs/CONVENTIONS.md`](../docs/CONVENTIONS.md)
- Ledger: [`scoreboard.tsv`](scoreboard.tsv) · Journal (working window): [`JOURNAL.md`](JOURNAL.md) ·
  Logbook (append-only full record — grep, don't read whole): [`logbook.md`](logbook.md) · Discoveries:
  [`DISCOVERIES.md`](DISCOVERIES.md)

## Naming & traceability
Every artifact is named/keyed by the experiment label **`exp<NN>_<slug>`** so it traces back to its row
here: `configs/exp<NN>_<slug>.json`, `results/snapshots/exp<NN>_<slug>/`, `results/result_<NN>.json`,
`results/images/exp<NN>_<slug>_*`, diagnostics logs. No orphan files.

